				"⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				5,
				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Vine): Update protocol structure documentation to reflect current distribution\n\nReplace the obsolete file tree diagram with an accurate table showing that `.proto` definitions and implementations currently reside within their consuming components (`Mountain`, `Cocoon`, `Grove`) rather than a centralized `Element/Vine/Source` directory.\n\nThe update clarifies the location of `Vine.proto` in `Mountain/Proto`, `Grove.proto` in `Grove`, and the specific client/server implementations in Rust and TypeScript. It also correctly identifies the auto-generated `RouteManifest.ts` in `Cocoon`.\n\nThis ensures the README accurately guides developers to the correct source files for the gRPC contract and its transport layers, aligning with the project's modular architecture.",
			"SHA": "1e556d5cf480e5846dd77a04270ead496d2b19ee"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
